# Finder/editor duplicates ("db 2.ts" and friends). One had been sitting in
# src/engine/ since 2026-07-28, imported by nothing; twice in S29 a `git add src/`
# swept it into a LOCAL commit, and both times it was removed before anything was
# pushed, so it never reached a published commit. The owner had it deleted at the
# end of S29. The rule stays because the editor can mint another one at any time,
# and `tsconfig.include` is `["src"]` — a stray duplicate is inside the
# `tsc --noEmit` program, so it is a gate hazard as well as a publishing one.
*\ [0-9].ts
*\ [0-9].tsx
